  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 8 - 9 × 4 ÷ 6 + 7 = 5\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the two signs and two numbers:\n\nOption 1) + and -, 9 and 6\n\n8 - 9 × 4 ÷ 6 + 7 = 5 ⇒ 8 + 6 × 4 ÷ 9 - 7 = 5\n\n⇒ 8 + 6 × __**4 ÷ 9**__ - 7 = 5\n\n⇒ 8 + __**6 × 0.44**__ - 7 = 5\n\n⇒ __**8 + 3**__ - 7 = 5\n\n⇒ __**11 - 7**__ = 5\n\n⇒ 4 ≠ 5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) + and -, 8 and 7\n\n8 - 9 × 4 ÷ 6 + 7 = 5 ⇒ 7 + 9 × 4 ÷ 6 - 8 = 5\n\n⇒ 7 + 9 × __**4 ÷ 6**__ - 8 = 5\n\n⇒ 7 + __**9 × 2/3**__ - 8 = 5\n\n⇒ __**7 + 6**__ - 8 = 5\n\n⇒ __**13 - 8**__ = 5\n\n**⇒ 5 = 5 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3) × and ÷, 6 and 7\n\n8 - 9 × 4 ÷ 6 + 7 = 5 ⇒ 8 - 9 ÷ 4 × 7 + 6 = 5\n\n⇒ 8 - __**9 ÷ 4**__ × 7 + 6 = 5\n\n⇒ 8 - __**2.25 × 7**__ + 6 = 5\n\n⇒ __**8 + 6**__ - 15.75 = 5\n\n⇒ __**14 - 15.75**__ = 5\n\n⇒ -1.75 ≠ 5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) ÷ and +, 8 and 7\n\n8 - 9 × 4 ÷ 6 + 7 = 5 ⇒ 7 - 9 × 4 + 6 ÷ 8 = 5\n\n⇒ 7 - 9 × 4 + __**6 **____**÷**____** 8**__ = 5\n\n⇒ 7 - __**9 × 4**__ + 0.75 = 5\n\n⇒ __**7 + 0.75**__ - 36 = 5\n\n⇒ __**7.75 - 36**__ = 5\n\n⇒ -28.25 ≠ 5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
